== size_for_a_table
note: 6 rows with NA in educ or wage dropped (line 2)
error[Z0401]: `size:` belongs to the export of a plot, and this is a Table
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:37
  |
3 | w.describe().export("w.docx", size: slide)
  |                                     ^^^^^ not used for a table or a result
  |
  = help: leave `size:` out; a table takes the width of the page of the document it is put in

== notes_for_a_table
note: 6 rows with NA in educ or wage dropped (line 2)
error[Z0401]: `notes:` belongs to the export of a plot, and this is a Table
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:38
  |
3 | w.describe().export("w.docx", notes: true)
  |                                      ^^^^ not used for a table or a result
  |
  = help: leave `notes:` out; the notes of a table are the lines under it, and they are always written

